WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.325
The same constellation, now lit by truth.

00:00:04.525 --> 00:00:09.100
Bright means it runs. Dim means it is planned. The spark means seed.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:16.325
Push into Trace: ten million tokens, one hundred twenty probes, every path replayable.

00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:22.850
Each builder shows its next milestone, dated, or marked owner pending.

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:30.500
Substrate survives kill nine. S T C signs receipts. S S T argues in test mode.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:36.625
Entorhinal advises and never acts. Reflex stays a labeled seed.

00:00:37.825 --> 00:00:42.875
Proposals stay proposals until adopted. Delivered notes are not agreement.

00:00:44.675 --> 00:00:49.325
No invented dates. Where the owner has not set one, the map waits.

00:00:50.525 --> 00:00:55.775
The map of a mind, with the lights telling the truth.  Open it.
